                        <p className="text-[10px] text-blue-300 leading-relaxed mt-2">※売却時の損益を居住期間で割った「真の家賃」相当額です。</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div className="space-y-4">
                      <div className="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400">
                        <div className="bg-white/10 p-1.5 rounded-lg"><ArrowRightLeft size={16} /></div>
                        <span className="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest">同等物件の賃貸コスト内訳</span>
                      </div>
                      <div className="bg-white/5 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-white/5 space-y-2">
                        <div className="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-white/10 pb-1"><span>想定家賃</span><span className="text-white">{formatCurrency(rentalBase)}</span></div>
                        <div className="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-white/10 pb-1"><span>管理費・共益費(5%)</span><span className="text-white">{formatCurrency(rentalManagement)}</span></div>
                        <div className="flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 border-b border-white/10 pb-1"><span>更新料(月換算)</span><span className="text-white">{formatCurrency(rentalRenewalMonthly)}</span></div>
                        <div className="flex justify-between items-center pt-2">
                          <span className="text-xs font-black text-slate-300">賃貸 月額合計</span>
                          <div className="text-2xl font-black text-slate-300">{formatCurrency(totalMonthlyRental)}<span className="text-xs ml-1 font-normal">/月</span></div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div className="mt-10 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 px-8 py-4 rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/20">
                    <p className="text-sm font-black text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                      <CheckCircle2 size={18} />
                      賃貸と比較して毎月 {formatCurrency(Math.max(0, totalMonthlyRental - realMonthlyCost))} の資産を守っています
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>

            {/* AI 解析 & 立地診断 */}
            <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
              <div className="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-3"><Waves className="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" /><h3 className="font-black text-slate-800">立地ハザード評価</h3></div>
                <div className="text-sm text-slate-600 bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 min-h-[120px]">
                  {loadingHazard ? <Loader2 className="animate-spin mx-auto text-blue-500" /> : hazardInfo ? hazardInfo.text : "AIがハザードリスクを判定します。"}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div className="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-3"><History className="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" /><h3 className="font-black text-slate-800">出口戦略・将来相場</h3></div>
                <div className="text-sm text-slate-600 bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 min-h-[120px]">
                  {loadingExit ? <Loader2 className="animate-spin mx-auto text-amber-500" /> : exitStrategy ? exitStrategy.text : "将来の売却見込みを予測します。"}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <section className="bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-10 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
              <div className="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-3"><div className="bg-indigo-100 p-2 rounded-xl"><BrainCircuit className="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600" /></div><h3 className="text-xl font-black text-slate-800">AI 財務診断</h3></div>
                <button onClick={runAiAnalysis} disabled={loadingAi} className="bg-slate-900 text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-black flex items-center gap-2 hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all">
                  {loadingAi ? <Loader2 size={14} className="animate-spin" /> : <Zap size={14} className="fill-current" />} 再診断
                </button>
              </div>
              <div className="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700 min-h-[150px] whitespace-pre-wrap bg-slate-50 p-8 rounded-[1.5rem] italic shadow-inner border border-slate-100">
